and full of compassion, and righteous.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ט) A good man sheweth favour, and lendeth:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(י) He will guide his affairs with discretion.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(כ) Surely he shall not be moved for ever:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ל) The righteous shall be in everlasting remembrance.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(מ) He shall not be afraid of evil tidings:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(נ) His heart is fixed, trusting in the Lord.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ס) His heart is established, he shall not be afraid,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ע) Until he see his desire upon his enemies.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(פ) He hath dispersed, he hath given to the poor;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(צ) His righteousness endureth for ever;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ק) His horn shall be exalted with honour.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ר) The wicked shall see it, and be grieved;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ש) He shall gnash with his teeth, and melt away:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"(ת) The desire of the wicked shall perish.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_cpb/PSA/112.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_cpb/PSA/113.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_cpb/PSA/111.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}